+  - Apply collectionLimits. An active card and its displayed start date establish neither continuous delivery nor a winning or profitable ad. Unknown or empty collections establish no absence of advertising.
+  - Use the selected selling angle as a direction to test. Keep its proof plan conditional in visual planning; never turn planned assets into completed demonstrations or observed results.
